# Build context for the FRONTEND image (docker/frontend/Dockerfile).
# The important part: frontend/node_modules from the host must NOT be copied
# over the container's `npm ci` install, and the local .env must not be baked
# into the bundle.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.venv
**/.claude
.git
